=== Isolated per-process FP16 matmul benchmark (CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES isolation) ===
Method: each GPU benchmarked in a separate process to avoid cross-GPU CUDA context bleed.
Warmup: 5 iterations before timing, 20 iterations timed.
Matrix: 8192x8192 FP16

GPU0 isolated: 1637.8 TFLOPS
GPU1 isolated: 1613.8 TFLOPS
(1.5% variance -- consistent with two identical B200s)

Note: earlier same-process, multi-GPU-in-one-script attempts produced
physically impossible results (122,325 TFLOPS) due to CUDA context
bleed between devices. Discarded, not used. This isolated-process
result is the valid one.

=== ECC + thermal check ===
GPU0: 0 corrected, 0 uncorrected ECC errors, 34C, 198.10W
GPU1: 0 corrected, 0 uncorrected ECC errors, 35C, 199.54W
